## BackupsApi

### Place a new off-site backup storage order and generate the invoice
## Place a new off-site backup storage order and generate the invoice
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/backups/order
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Cancel an off-site backup storage subscription
## Cancel an off-site backup storage subscription
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/backups/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

